  phase_2: ENABLED
  ar_4: READY_TO_START
  gate_b: PENDING

active_item:
  id: AR-4
  name: Modelo de Reconstrucción / Reconstruction Model
  position: Gate A passed; Phase II enabled; AR-4 next

invariants:
  - KOS-Lab authority preserved
  - KOS-Comm autonomy preserved
  - representation != represented object
  - Binding = explicit bilateral semantic seam
  - mapping capability != domain authority
  - candidate != accepted domain state
  - receipt != canonical import
  - reconstruction != authorization
  - identity mapping != identity authority
  - property strength may increase only with new independent explicit scoped justification/evidence
  - Binding policy = mapping admissibility; Domain policy = authoritative acceptance/action
  - declared contract compatibility != runtime semantic mappability
  - Binding composition safety must be validated, not assumed
  - KCA = neutral core
  - KOS Binding = domain-specific realization, not neutral core
  - encoding remains outside Phase I semantic core
  - KCP remains small, replaceable and outside Phase I semantic core
  - KSCL remains experimental/open decomposition

closed_items:
  - Gate 0 architectural consensus
  - KOS-Lab <-> KOS-Comm reconciliation
  - AR-1 Boundary Model
  - AR-2 Representation Model
  - AR-3 Binding Model
  - Gate A / Phase I

